
en=[
Almost every ManiaDrive track features jumps ! Let's learn 
to jump properly, since I may help you to save a few 
seconds on a whole track.
];

en=[
The only important thing about jumps is to be straight 
and centered on the road before the jump. That's all.
This will require a bit of experience,  but you must 
be able to keep your car perfectly straight at the 
end of a turn.
];

en=[
This track features 3 jumps and 2 corners. 
Take your time (gold time is 40 seconds),
and try to be clean.
];